tention.webp","alt":"GQA shared KV heads, MLA compressed KV latent with RoPE, and GDN recurrent state."},"language":"zh-Hans"},{"slug":"Clash-Verge设置","url":"/posts/Clash-Verge%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/","title":"Clash-Verge设置","date":"2026-05-15","description":"","tags":["VPN"],"categories":["工具"],"math":false,"mermaid":false,"image":null,"language":"zh-Hans"},{"slug":"推理INFRA方法论-03-hardware","url":"/posts/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86INFRA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BA-03-hardware/","title":"推理 INFRA 方法论（3）：推理硬件：GPU、NPU 与存储层级","date":"2026-05-11","description":"把算力、HBM、片上缓存和互联放在同一张预算表中，理解不同硬件为什么需要不同的算子与部署策略。","tags":["LLM","AI-Infra","推理优化"],"categories":["工程篇"],"math":true,"mermaid":false,"image":{"src":"/assets/img/inference-infra/covers/03-hardware.webp","alt":"Conceptual GPU and NPU memory hierarchy: HBM, L2 cache, on-chip SRAM, and matrix compute."},"language":"zh-Hans"},{"slug":"推理INFRA方法论-02-parallelism","url":"/posts/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86INFRA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BA-02-parallelism/","title":"推理 INFRA 方法论（2）：分布式推理：TP、DP、EP、CP 与 PP 的取舍","date":"2026-03-29","description":"围绕权重、KV、激活和通信预算，推演 Attention 与 MoE 的并行组合，并分析长上下文和流水线的额外约束。","tags":["LLM","AI-Infra","推理优化"],"categories":["工程篇"],"math":true,"mermaid":false,"image":{"src":"/assets/img/inference-infra/covers/02-parallelism.webp","alt":"Tensor, data, expert, context, and pipeline parallelism shown as five partitioning strategies."},"language":"zh-Hans"},{"slug":"Blog-Agents功能介绍","url":"/posts/Blog-Agents%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D/","title":"Blog Agents功能介绍","date":"2026-02-23","description":"","tags":["Agents","AI","数据分析"],"categories":["工具"],"math":false,"mermaid":false,"image":null,"language":"zh-Hans"},{"slug":"推理INFRA方法论-01-communication","url":"/posts/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86INFRA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BA-01-communication/","title":"推理 INFRA 方法论（1）：通信模型：从集合原语到跨机拓扑","date":"2026-02-13","description":"把集合通信拆成步数、启动时延和每卡字节数，再结合 NVLink、RDMA、NUMA 与 PCIe 拓扑解释实测差异。","tags":["LLM","AI-Infra","推理优化"],"categories":["工程篇"],"mat